  "body_html": "<p>Embrace rustic elegance with our Farmhouse Quilt Set, designed to bring countryside charm and warmth to your bedroom. This quilt set features classic patterns and soft fabrics, perfect for adding a touch of tradition and cozy comfort to your home, and makes a thoughtful personalized gift for loved ones.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Rustic Farmhouse Design:</strong> Features classic patterns and a charming patchwork style, perfect for adding a touch of warmth and tradition to any bedroom.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> An ideal present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Options:</strong> Customize with your name and select from various sizes, with the option to add more pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102''x91'').</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable; wash separately in cold water and air dry without heat for best results, maintaining its fluffiness.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from soft and durable polycotton fabric.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polycotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Patchwork Style Pattern</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Farmhouse Print</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Dragonfly</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>1 text input (Name)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90''), King (102''x91'')</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
